---
import { PLANS, PLAN_GROUPS } from '../../data/plans';
import { SITE } from '../../config/site';
import PlanCard from './PlanCard.astro';
---
<section class="section" id="plans" aria-labelledby="plans-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">套餐方案</p>
      <h2 id="plans-title">灵动云套餐价格：{PLANS.length} 档方案</h2>
      <p>付款方式与流量周期分开标注，选择前请留意是“每月额度”还是“总流量包”。</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="plan-legend" aria-label="套餐类型说明">
      {PLAN_GROUPS.map((g) => (
        <li class={`lg-${g.key}`}>
          <strong>{g.title}</strong>
          <span>{g.desc}</span>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <div class="plan-grid">
      {PLANS.map((p) => <PlanCard plan={p} />)}
    </div>

    <div class="plan-notes">
      <p>
        价格与流量来自运营方提供的套餐资料（整理于 {SITE.dataUpdated}），尚未与在线结算页逐项核对；月付档位标注“起”，最终价格以结算页为准。
      </p>
      <p>
        月度额度的重置日期、结转规则、设备数、速率与退款政策请在用户中心查看。1.5TB 按 1500GB 计。一次性流量包的有效期与使用规则以后台条款为准。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .plan-legend {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  .plan-legend li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .plan-legend strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .plan-legend span {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .plan-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    column-gap: 20px;
    row-gap: 34px;
  }
  .plan-notes {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text);
    display: grid;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 1199px) {
    .plan-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .plan-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .plan-legend {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
    }
    .plan-legend li {
      border-radius: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      row-gap: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
